  "jobTitle": "Lead Software Engineer / Business Analyst",
  "summary": "Accomplished professional who brings more than 25 years of experience in analysis, design, transformation, implementation and support of financial and enterprise applications. Has a proven track record for designing solutions, pinpointing opportunities and improving efficiencies.  Strong skills in re-engineering and systematizing processes with a strategic focus.  Organized and detail oriented with proactive and hardworking nature. Highly adept communicator and collaborator and passionate about providing new solutions by building relationship with strategic partners.\n\nCore Competencies\n•\tSystems Processing & Implementation\n•\tProblem Solving\n•\tSoftware Development and Coding\n•\tTechnical Design Documentation\n•\tData Analytics and Reporting\n•\tSystems Analysis and Design\t\n•\tRequirements Gathering\n•\tFit/Gap Analysis\n•\tCollaboration with Technical and Functional Team\n\nAPPLICATION/ERP PROFICIENCIES\nPeopleSoft FSCM System (Treasury Management System, General Ledger, Accounts Payables, Accounts Receivables, Billing, Asset Management, Purchasing, eProcurement, Project Costing), Oracle eBusiness Suite for Financials Accounting Hub\n\nTECHNICAL PROFICIENCIES:\nWindows/Solaris, OBIEE, ODI (Oracle Data Integrator),PeopleTools, PeopleCode, N/vision, SQL, Oracle, Unix, SQR, Cobol, Unix/Linux Shell scripting,  Microsoft Office Suite\n\n",
